       variety gave stop 03 a 1:1 frame — 176px against 135–142px for every
       other stop, 30% taller — and it was the one image the route ran across.
       The variety in this row comes from the six different Y offsets, which is
       where the reference puts it too; six matched crops travelling at six
       heights read as a journey, six mismatched ones read as a mistake. */
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: scale var(--sb-dur-image) var(--sb-ease);
